cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the accompanying article
  (see preferred-citation) and the archived software version you used.
type: software
title: "Approximate Graph Symmetries: continuous relaxations of the approximate symmetry problem"
abstract: >-
  Implementation and experiment pipeline for continuous relaxations of the
  Approximate Symmetry Problem (ASP): the Quadratic Symmetry Approximator (QSA)
  baseline, an interior-point method (IP), orthogonal relaxation (OR),
  Riemannian manifold optimization on the doubly stochastic matrices (MF), and
  a dimensionality-reduction method (DR), together with the random graph
  generators and parameter-sweep scripts used in the article.
